## Contributing to MyLinks

Thank you for considering contributing to MyLinks! We appreciate your time and want to keep the contribution process smooth and transparent.

The full guide — development setup, pull request guidelines, and the test suites — lives at **[docs.mylinks.app/contributing](https://docs.mylinks.app/contributing)**.

Before opening a pull request, run locally what CI runs on every push and PR ([`.github/workflows/ci.yml`](https://github.com/my-links/my-links/blob/main/.github/workflows/ci.yml)):

```bash
pnpm run check && just test
```

Bug reports and feature requests go through [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/my-links/my-links/issues). Join [our Trello board](https://trello.com/b/CwxkMeZp/mylinks) for roadmap discussions.

Thank you for helping make MyLinks better!
